<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-INDY CAR QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-INDY CAR QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>NAZARETH, PA. 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top ten qualifiers on</p>
<p>Saturday for Sunday's CART Indy Car race at Nazareth (tabulate</p>
<p>by driver, country, chassis, motor, lap speed):</p>
<p>1. Paul Tracy (Canada) Penske Mercedes-Benz, 18.831</p>
<p>seconds(191.174 mph)</p>
<p>2. Michael Andretti (U.S.) Swift Ford, 19.163</p>
<p>3. Patrick Carpentier (Canada) Reynard Mercedes-Benz,</p>
<p>19.204</p>
<p>4. Gil de Ferran (Brazil) Reynard Honda, 19.265</p>
<p>5. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil) Reynard Mercedes-Benz,</p>
<p>19.321</p>
<p>6. Raul Boesel (Brazil) Reynard Ford, 19.345</p>
<p>7. Al Unser, Jr. (U.S.) Penske Mercedes-Benz, 19,382</p>
<p>8. Bobby Rahal (U.S.) Reynard Ford, 19.421</p>
<p>9. Bryan Herta (U.S.) Reynard Ford, 19.423</p>
<p>10. Greg Moore (Canada) Reynard Mercedes-Benz 19.520</p>
